Metrics Overview

LLM Service (Code 3)

policy_llm:tpot_p95:2m → P95 token latency

policy_llm:http_error_rate:5m/1h → error budget

policy_llm:queue_growth_rate:5m → saturation


PII Worker (Code 4)

pii_enqueue_total

pii_worker_success_total

pii_worker_failure_total

pii_worker_retry_total

pii_dlq_total

pii_processing_latency_seconds


API Service (Code 5)

api_requests_total

api_request_duration_seconds

ingestion_queue_length

llm_calls_total

llm_latency_seconds

idempotent_requests_total

s3_upload_tasks



---

Key Advantages

1. End-to-end auditability (ingestion → LLM → deletion)


2. Enterprise-grade reliability: retries, backoff, DLQ, and circuit breakers


3. Scalable & observable: Prometheus + Grafana + automated remediation


4. PII compliance: encryption, audit, transactional deletion


5. High-throughput ingestion: 6000+ requests/min, rate-limited and idempotent




