Legend / Notes:

Redis Stream: central message queue for ingestion → LLM → risk scoring → PII deletion.

Automated Remediation in LLM service scales inference pods or fails over regions when error budget or saturation thresholds are hit.

PII Worker ensures secure, auditable deletion and generates chained hashes for compliance.

Observability spans all components: metrics, dashboards, and error tracking.

Background Tasks like S3 uploads do not block ingestion and report to metrics.



